    "slug": "owlet-dream-sock-baby-monitor-vs-nuna-pipa-rx-infant-car-seat-which-has-lower-long-term-re",
    "title": "Owlet Dream Sock Baby Monitor vs Nuna PIPA RX Infant Car Seat: Which Has Lower Long-Term Regret?",
