    "slug": "snoo-smart-sleeper-bassinet-vs-nuna-pipa-rx-infant-car-seat-which-has-lower-long-term-regr",
    "title": "SNOO Smart Sleeper Bassinet vs Nuna PIPA RX Infant Car Seat: Which Has Lower Long-Term Regret?",
